    "Name": "Raven RVN-1XR",
    "Details": "The Raven RVN-1XR is a commonly seen battlefield refit of the Raven 1X to update it with more modern technology. The lasers have been upgrade to pulse versions, an Artemis IV FCS was added to the SRM-6 launcher and the heat sinks was switch to doubles. The EW equipment is replaced by a Guardian ECM, a Beagle Active Probe and a C3 Slave computer. Even after all these upgrades enough space still remains to also add additional armor.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Jammer</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
